    "methods_description": "EEG was recorded from 15 healthy participants (ages 18-27) with a 24-channel mBrainTrain Smarting system at 500 Hz, FCz reference and Fpz ground. A traditional cue-based paradigm (visual and auditory cues, 5 beeps at 1.4 s rhythm, 7 imagined speech repetitions with the last 3 analyzed) was compared with a gamified Pac-Man maze paradigm. Each participant completed 2 sessions of 120 trials (30 per class).",
